<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-σκοπέω</span></b> , c. fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκέψομαι,</span>
		aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεσκεψάμην</span>: (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασκέπτομαι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look at narrowly, examine well,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντ᾽ ἀνασκόπει καλῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					666
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.132
			</span></i>, etc.:—also in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασκοπουμένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					827
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>look back at, reckon up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				5.11
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
